<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Swiss Re.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Swiss Re.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 15 million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Reinsurance shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs Group said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 200 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2400 SFR		  PREMIUM	22.03 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.21 SFR		  GEARING	8.95 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.AUG.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	13.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2165 SFR</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    GSJR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
